    "detailed_description": "The road is your greatest challenge in She is Home Alone! It will do whatever it takes to stop you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880500/extras/637affd731fe4126dfc7b91b95916a05.poster.avif?t=1746371001\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880500/extras/637affd731fe4126dfc7b91b95916a05.webm?t=1746371001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880500/extras/637affd731fe4126dfc7b91b95916a05.mp4?t=1746371001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pilot your way through a world suspended in the clouds.<br></li><li>Experience an endless journey through the skies, where each attempt brings you closer to your heart's desire.<br></li><li>Don't let the frustration make you give up! <br></li><li>Groove to the beats of a captivating synthwave soundtrack as you soar through the skies.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880500/extras/fe700ba73030346ad343e656797c604a.avif?t=1746371001\" width=598 height=134 /></span><br><strong><i>She is Home Alone with</i></strong> its thrilling synthwave soundtrack. Crafted by talented composers Rusted Music Studio and Alkakrab, this soundtrack pulses with nostalgic beats and melodies, perfectly complementing the game's ambience.<br><br>Come to heaven like no other in She is Home Alone<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880500/extras/daa0f934359f8ed6e577c1de6c6829e0.avif?t=1746371001\" width=540 height=144 /></span>",
